</section>
<section id="fs-idm94405216" class="exercises">
<title>Efnafræði – Æfingar í lok kafla</title>
<exercise id="fs-idm94404336">
<problem id="fs-idm94404080">
<para id="fs-idm94403824">Útskýrðu hvers vegna hlutleysingarhvarf sterkrar sýru og veiks basa gefur örlítið súra lausn.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm94046624">
<problem id="fs-idm94046368">
<para id="fs-idm94046112">Útskýrðu hvers vegna hlutleysingarhvarf veikrar sýru og sterks basa gefur örlítið basíska lausn.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm94045488">
<para id="fs-idm94045232">Saltið jónast í lausninni en anjónin hvarfast örlítið við vatn og myndar veiku sýruna. Þetta hvarf myndar einnig OH<sup>−</sup> sem veldur því að lausnin verður basísk.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm97090576">
<problem id="fs-idm97090320">
<para id="fs-idm97090064">Notaðu þennan lista yfir mikilvæg iðnaðarefnasambönd (og <link target-id="CNX_Chem_14_03_Corresp"/>) til að svara eftirfarandi spurningum varðandi: Ca(OH)<sub>2</sub>, CH<sub>3</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H, HCl, H<sub>2</sub>CO<sub>3</sub>, HF, HNO<sub>2</sub>, HNO<sub>3</sub>, H<sub>3</sub>PO<sub>4</sub>, H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>, NH<sub>3</sub>, NaOH, Na<sub>2</sub>CO<sub>3</sub>.</para>
<para id="fs-idm5843184">(a) Tilgreindu sterkar Brønsted-Lowry sýrur og sterka Brønsted-Lowry basa.</para>
<para id="fs-idm5842624">(b) Tilgreindu efnasamböndin sem geta hagað sér eins og Brønsted-Lowry sýrur með styrkleika á milli H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup> og H<sub>2</sub>O.</para>
<para id="fs-idm5839824">(c) Tilgreindu efnasamböndin sem geta hagað sér eins og Brønsted-Lowry basar með styrkleika á milli H<sub>2</sub>O og OH<sup>−</sup>.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm102500528">
<problem id="fs-idm102500272">
<para id="fs-idm102500016">Edikslykt stafar af ediksýru, CH<sub>3</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H, sem er veik sýra. Skráðu, í lækkandi styrkleikaröð, allar jóna- og sameindategundir sem eru til staðar í 1-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> vatnslausn af þessari sýru.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm157701984">
<para id="fs-idm157701728">[H<sub>2</sub>O] &gt; [CH<sub>3</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H] &gt; <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:msup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> ≈ <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> &gt; [OH<sup>−</sup>]</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm81289984">
<problem id="fs-idm81289728">
<para id="fs-idm81289472">Heimilissammoníak er lausn af veika basanum NH<sub>3</sub> í vatni. Skráðu, í lækkandi styrkleikaröð, allar jóna- og sameindategundir sem eru til staðar í 1-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> vatnslausn af þessum basa.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm82919280">
<problem id="fs-idm82919024">
<para id="fs-idm82918768">Útskýrðu hvers vegna jónunarfastinn, <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub>, fyrir H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> er stærri en jónunarfastinn fyrir H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>3</sub>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm98075952">
<para id="fs-idm98075696">Oxunartala brennisteins í H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> er hærri en oxunartala brennisteins í H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>3</sub>.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm98073520">
<problem id="fs-idm98073264">
<para id="fs-idm98073008">Útskýrðu hvers vegna jónunarfastinn, <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub>, fyrir HI er stærri en jónunarfastinn fyrir HF.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm98070544">
<problem id="fs-idm98070288">
<para id="fs-idm98070032">Magasafi, meltingarvökvinn sem framleiddur er í maganum, inniheldur saltsýru, HCl. Magnesíummjólk, sem er grugga af föstu Mg(OH)<sub>2</sub> í vatnskenndum miðli, er stundum notuð til að hlutleysa umfram magasýru. Skrifaðu fullstillta jöfnu fyrir hlutleysingarhvarfið og tilgreindu samoka sýru-basa pörin.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp38933040">
<para id="fs-idp38933296"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:mrow><m:mtext>Mg</m:mtext><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mtext>OH</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>s</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mrow><m:mtext>2HCl</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⟶</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>Mg</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2+</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mtext>Cl</m:mtext><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>2H</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>l</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:mrow><m:mtext>BB</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mrow><m:mtext>BA</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd><m:mrow><m:mtext>CB</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd><m:mrow><m:mtext>CA</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd/></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp121913696">
<problem id="fs-idp10256960">
<para id="fs-idp10257216">Saltpéturssýra hvarfast við óleysanlegt kopar(II)oxíð og myndar leysanlegt kopar(II)nítrat, Cu(NO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>, efnasamband sem hefur verið notað til að koma í veg fyrir þörungavöxt í sundlaugum. Skrifaðu stillta efnajöfnu fyrir hvarf vatnslausnar af HNO<sub>3</sub> við CuO.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp54392720">
<problem id="fs-idp54392976">
<para id="fs-idp54393232">Hver er jónunarfastinn við 25 °C fyrir veiku sýruna <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>, samoka sýru veika basans CH<sub>3</sub>NH<sub>2</sub>, <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b</sub> = 4,4 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−4</sup>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm79744112">
<para id="fs-idm79743856"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>a</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−11</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm38113296">
<problem id="fs-idm38113040">
<para id="fs-idm38112784">Hver er jónunarfastinn við 25 °C fyrir veiku sýruna <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math>, samoka sýru veika basans (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>NH, <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b</sub> = 5,9 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−4</sup>?</para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm176650240">
<problem id="fs-idm176649984">
<para id="fs-idm176649728">Hvort er sterkari basinn, CH<sub>3</sub>NH<sub>2</sub> eða (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>NH? Hvor samoka sýran, <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> eða <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>, er sterkari sýran?</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-idp68571296">
<para id="fs-idp68571552">Sterkari basinn eða sterkari sýran er sá/sú sem hefur hærra <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b</sub> eða <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> gildi. Í þessum tveimur dæmum eru það (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>NH og <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp82803792">
<problem id="fs-idp82804048">
<para id="fs-idp82804304">Hvort er sterkari sýran, <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> eða HBrO?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp38295632">
<problem id="fs-idp38295888">
<para id="fs-idp38296144">Hvort er sterkari basinn, (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>N eða <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>BO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp38299984">
<para id="fs-idp85603968">tríetýlamín</para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm157978560">
<problem id="fs-idm157978304">
<para id="fs-idm157978048">Spáðu fyrir um hvor sýran í eftirfarandi pörum er sterkari og útskýrðu rökstuðning þinn fyrir hvoru um sig.</para>
<para id="fs-idm157977552">(a) H<sub>2</sub>O eða HF</para>
<para id="fs-idm157976784">(b) B(OH)<sub>3</sub> eða Al(OH)<sub>3</sub></para>
<para id="fs-idm157975760">(c) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HSO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> eða <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HSO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idm157971920">(d) NH<sub>3</sub> eða H<sub>2</sub>S</para>
<para id="fs-idp58796160">(e) H<sub>2</sub>O eða H<sub>2</sub>Te</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm117245456">
<problem id="fs-idm117245200">
<para id="fs-idm117244944">Spáðu fyrir um hvort efnasambandið í eftirfarandi pörum efnasambanda er súrara og útskýrðu rökstuðning þinn fyrir hvoru um sig.</para>
<para id="fs-idm117244432">(a) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HSO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> eða <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HSeO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idp39171888">(b) NH<sub>3</sub> eða H<sub>2</sub>O</para>
<para id="fs-idp39173040">(c) PH<sub>3</sub> eða HI</para>
<para id="fs-idp39173808">(d) NH<sub>3</sub> eða PH<sub>3</sub></para>
<para id="fs-idp39174832">(e) H<sub>2</sub>S eða HBr</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp39175728">
<para id="fs-idp39175984">(a) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HSO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> hærri rafneikvæðni miðjujónarinnar. (b) H<sub>2</sub>O; NH<sub>3</sub> er basi og vatn er hlutlaust, eða ákvarðaðu á grundvelli <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> gilda. (c) HI; PH<sub>3</sub> er veikara en HCl; HCl er veikara en HI. Þess vegna er PH<sub>3</sub> veikara en HI. (d) PH<sub>3</sub>; í tvíefnasamböndum vetnis við málmleysingja eykst sýrustigið fyrir frumefnið sem er neðar í flokki. (e) HBr; í lotu eykst sýrustigið frá vinstri til hægri; í flokki eykst það ofan frá og niður. Br er til vinstri og fyrir neðan S, þannig að HBr er sterkari sýran.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp33478144">
<problem id="fs-idp33478400">
<para id="fs-idp33478656">Raðaðu efnasamböndunum í hverjum eftirfarandi hópa eftir vaxandi sýrustigi eða basastyrk, eins og tilgreint er, og útskýrðu röðina sem þú velur.</para>
<para id="fs-idp33479200">(a) sýrustig: HCl, HBr, HI</para>
<para id="fs-idp33479584">(b) basastyrkur: H<sub>2</sub>O, OH<sup>−</sup>, H<sup>−</sup>, Cl<sup>−</sup></para>
<para id="fs-idp33481376">(c) basastyrkur: Mg(OH)<sub>2</sub>, Si(OH)<sub>4</sub>, ClO<sub>3</sub>(OH) (Vísbending: Einnig mætti skrifa formúluna sem HClO<sub>4</sub>.)</para><para id="fs-idm14022912">(d) sýrustig: HF, H<sub>2</sub>O, NH<sub>3</sub>, CH<sub>4</sub></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm83972448">
<problem id="fs-idm83972192">
<para id="fs-idm83971936">Raðaðu efnasamböndunum í hverjum eftirfarandi hópa eftir vaxandi sýrustigi eða basastyrk, eins og tilgreint er, og útskýrðu röðina sem þú velur.</para>
<para id="fs-idm83971392">(a) sýrustig: NaHSO<sub>3</sub>, NaHSeO<sub>3</sub>, NaHSO<sub>4</sub></para>
<para id="fs-idm83969984">(b) basastyrkur: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>BrO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>ClO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>IO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idp33342400">(c) sýrustig: HOCl, HOBr, HOI</para>
<para id="fs-idp33342784">(d) sýrustig: HOCl, HOClO, HOClO<sub>2</sub>, HOClO<sub>3</sub></para>
<para id="fs-idp33343808">(e) basastyrkur: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> HS<sup>−</sup>, HTe<sup>−</sup>, <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>PH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idp54362976">(f) basastyrkur: BrO<sup>−</sup>, <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>BrO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>BrO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>BrO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp54369632">
<para id="fs-idp10890112">(a) NaHSeO<sub>3</sub> &lt; NaHSO<sub>3</sub> &lt; NaHSO<sub>4</sub>; í fjöloxósýrum myndar rafneikvæðara miðjufrumefnið – S, í þessu tilfelli – sterkari sýruna. Stærri fjöldi súrefnisatóma á miðjuatóminu (sem gefur því hærra oxunarástand) veldur einnig meiri losun vetnisatóma, sem leiðir til sterkari sýru. Sem salt eykst sýrustigið á sama hátt. (b) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>ClO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>BrO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>IO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> basastyrkur anjónanna í röð sýra verður andstæða sýrustigsins í oxósýrum þeirra. Sýrustigið eykst eftir því sem rafneikvæðni miðjuatómsins eykst. Cl er rafneikvæðara en Br og I er minnst rafneikvætt af þeim þremur. (c) HOI &lt; HOBr &lt; HOCl; í röð oxósýra af sömu gerð eykst sýrustigið eftir því sem rafneikvæðni miðjuatómsins eykst. Cl er rafneikvæðara en Br og I er minnst rafneikvætt af þeim þremur. (d) HOCl &lt; HOClO &lt; HOClO<sub>2</sub> &lt; HOClO<sub>3</sub>; í röð oxósýra með sama miðjufrumefni eykst sýrustigið eftir því sem fjöldi súrefnisatóma eykst (eða eftir því sem oxunarástand miðjuatómsins eykst). (e) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>HTe</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>HS</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>&lt;&lt;</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>PH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>PH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> og <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> eru anjónir veikra basa, þannig að þær virka sem sterkir basar gagnvart H<sup>+</sup>. <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mtext>HTe</m:mtext><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> og HS<sup>−</sup> eru anjónir veikra sýra, þannig að þær hafa minni basaeiginleika. Í lotukerfisflokki hefur rafneikvæðara frumefnið basískari anjón. (f) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>BrO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>BrO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>BrO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>BrO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> með stærri fjölda súrefnisatóma (þ.e. eftir því sem oxunarástand miðjujónarinnar eykst) verður samsvarandi sýra súrari og anjónin þar af leiðandi minna basísk.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm79428208">
<problem id="fs-idm79427952">
<para id="fs-idm79427696">Bæði HF og HCN jónast í vatni að takmörkuðu leyti. Hvor samoka basinn, F<sup>−</sup> eða CN<sup>−</sup>, er sterkari basinn?</para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm79424752">
<problem id="fs-idm79424496">
<para id="fs-idm79424240">Virka efnið sem myndast úr aspiríni í líkamanum er salisýlsýra, C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>4</sub>OH(CO<sub>2</sub>H). Karboxýlhópurinn (–CO<sub>2</sub>H) virkar sem veik sýra. Fenólhópurinn (OH-hópur tengdur arómatískum hring) virkar einnig sem sýra en mun veikari sýra. Skráðu, í röð eftir minnkandi styrk, allar jóna- og sameindategundir sem eru til staðar í 0,001-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> vatnslausn af C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>4</sub>OH(CO<sub>2</sub>H).</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp9076048">
<para id="fs-idp9076304"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>OH</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>[H</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mtext>]</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>0</m:mtext><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>[C</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>OH</m:mtext><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>≫</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>OH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm81298048">
<problem id="fs-idm81297792">
<para id="fs-idm81297536">Eru styrkir hýdróníumjónar og hýdroxíðjónar í lausn sýru eða basa í vatni í beinu eða öfugu hlutfalli? Útskýrðu svarið.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp78760144">
<problem id="fs-idp78760400">
<para id="fs-idp78760656">Hvaða tvær algengu forsendur geta einfaldað útreikning á jafnvægisstyrk í lausn veikrar sýru eða basa?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp78761296">
<para id="fs-idp78761552">1. Gerðu ráð fyrir að hægt sé að vanrækja breytinguna á upphafsstyrk sýrunnar þegar jafnvægi er náð, þannig að hægt sé að gera ráð fyrir að þessi styrkur sé fastur og jafngildi upphafsgildi heildarstyrks sýrunnar. 2. Gerðu ráð fyrir að við getum vanrækt framlag vatns til jafnvægisstyrks H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm4769600">
<problem id="fs-idm4769344">
<para id="fs-idm4769088">Hvað af eftirfarandi mun auka hlutfall NH<sub>3</sub> sem breytist í ammóníumjón í vatni?</para>
<para id="fs-idm4768128">(a) viðbót NaOH</para>
<para id="fs-idm4767744">(b) viðbót HCl</para>
<para id="fs-idm4767360">(c) viðbót NH<sub>4</sub>Cl</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm4766464">
<para id="fs-idm4766208">(b) Viðbót HCl</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp75773712">
<problem id="fs-idp75773968">
<para id="fs-idp75774224">Hvað af eftirfarandi mun auka hlutfall HF sem breytist í flúoríðjón í vatni?</para>
<para id="fs-idp75774720">(a) viðbót NaOH</para>
<para id="fs-idp75775104">(b) viðbót HCl</para>
<para id="fs-idp75775488">(c) viðbót NaF</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp5155408">
<problem id="fs-idp5155664">
<para id="fs-idp5155920">Hver eru áhrifin á styrk <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> HNO<sub>2</sub> og OH<sup>−</sup> þegar eftirfarandi er bætt við lausn af KNO<sub>2</sub> í vatni:</para>
<para id="fs-idp5159504">(a) HCl</para>
<para id="fs-idp5159888">(b) HNO<sub>2</sub></para>
<para id="fs-idp5160528">(c) NaOH</para>
<para id="fs-idp5160912">(d) NaCl</para>
<para id="fs-idp38077152">(e) KNO<sub>2</sub></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm87543168">
<para id="fs-idm87542912">(a) Með því að bæta við HCl bætast við H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup> jónir, sem hvarfast síðan við OH<sup>−</sup> jónirnar og lækka styrk þeirra. Jafnvægið hliðrast til hægri, sem eykur styrk HNO<sub>2</sub> og minnkar styrk <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> jóna. (b) Með því að bæta við HNO<sub>2</sub> eykst styrkur HNO<sub>2</sub> og jafnvægið hliðrast til vinstri, sem eykur styrk <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> jóna og minnkar styrk OH<sup>−</sup> jóna. (c) Með því að bæta við NaOH bætast við OH<sup>−</sup> jónir, sem hliðrar jafnvæginu til vinstri, eykur styrk <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> jóna og minnkar styrk HNO<sub>2</sub>. (d) Viðbót NaCl hefur engin áhrif á styrk jónanna. (e) Með því að bæta við KNO<sub>2</sub> bætast við <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> jónir og jafnvægið hliðrast til hægri, sem eykur styrk HNO<sub>2</sub> og OH<sup>−</sup> jóna.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp58815696">
<problem id="fs-idp58815952">
<para id="fs-idp58816208">Hver eru áhrifin á styrk flúorsýru, hýdróníumjónar og flúoríðjónar þegar eftirfarandi er bætt við aðskildar lausnir af flúorsýru?</para>
<para id="fs-idp58816768">(a) HCl</para>
<para id="fs-idp58817152">(b) KF</para>
<para id="fs-idp58817536">(c) NaCl</para>
<para id="fs-idp58817920">(d) KOH</para>
<para id="fs-idp58818304">(e) HF</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm13803280">
<problem id="fs-idm13803024">
<para id="fs-idm13802768">Af hverju ræðst styrkur hýdróníumjóna í lausn sem er 0,10 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> í HCl og 0,10 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> í HCOOH af styrk HCl?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm13801008">
<para id="fs-idm13800752">Þetta er tilfelli þar sem lausnin inniheldur blöndu af sýrum með mismunandi jónunarstyrk. Í lausninni er HCO<sub>2</sub>H aðallega til staðar sem HCO<sub>2</sub>H-sameindir vegna þess að jónun veiku sýrunnar er bæld niður af sterku sýrunni. Þess vegna leggur HCO<sub>2</sub>H óverulegt magn af hýdróníumjónum til lausnarinnar. Sterkari sýran, HCl, er ríkjandi framleiðandi hýdróníumjóna vegna þess að hún er fullkomlega jónuð. Í slíkri lausn ákvarðar sterkari sýran styrk hýdróníumjóna og jónun veikari sýrunnar er ákvörðuð af [H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>] sem sterkari sýran framleiðir.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm65088304">
<problem id="fs-idm65088048">
<para id="fs-idm65087792">Reiknaðu <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> fyrir hverja af veiku sýrunum og <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b</sub> fyrir hvern af veiku bösunum út frá gefnum jafnvægisstyrkjum.</para>
<para id="fs-idm109267584">(a) CH<sub>3</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:msup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 1,34 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 1,34 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idm113309072">[CH<sub>3</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H] = 9,866 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−2</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idm113306400">(b) ClO<sup>−</sup>: [OH<sup>−</sup>] = 4,0 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−4</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idp36189824">[HClO] = 2,38 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−4</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idp36191728">[ClO<sup>−</sup>] = 0,273 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idp36193120">(c) HCO<sub>2</sub>H: [HCO<sub>2</sub>H] = 0,524 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:msup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 9,8 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HCO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 9,8 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idm83737680">(d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>:</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 0,233 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idm121296080">[C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>5</sub>NH<sub>2</sub>] = 2,3 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:msup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 2,3 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp68108464">
<problem id="fs-idp68108720">
<para id="fs-idp68108976">Reiknaðu <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> fyrir hverja af veiku sýrunum og <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b</sub> fyrir hvern af veiku bösunum út frá gefnum jafnvægisstyrkjum.</para>
<para id="fs-idp68111120">(a) NH<sub>3</sub>: [OH<sup>−</sup>] = 3,1 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 3,1 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idp69240176">[NH<sub>3</sub>] = 0,533 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idp69241568">(b) HNO<sub>2</sub>: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:msup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 0,011 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 0,0438 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idm1577296">[HNO<sub>2</sub>] = 1,07 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idm1575904">(c) (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>N: [(CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>N] = 0,25 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> [(CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>NH<sup>+</sup>] = 4,3 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idm94284096">[OH<sup>−</sup>] = 3,7 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idm94281808">(d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>:</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 0,100 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;</para>
<para id="fs-idp54458608">[NH<sub>3</sub>] = 7,5 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−6</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> [H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>] = 7,5 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−6</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm78118384">
<para id="fs-idm78118128">(a) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>b</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.8</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> (b) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>a</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.5</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> (c) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>b</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6.4</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> (d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>a</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5.6</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp58811168">
<problem id="fs-idp58811424">
<para id="fs-idp58811680">Ákvarðaðu <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b</sub> fyrir nítrítjónina, <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Í 0,10-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> lausn er þessi basi 0,0015% jónaður.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm71105088">
<problem id="fs-idm71104832">
<para id="fs-idm71104576">Ákvarðaðu <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> fyrir vetnissúlfatjónina, <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HSO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Í 0,10-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> lausn er sýran 29% jónuð.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm71100512">
<para id="fs-idm71100256"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>a</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm5851168">
<problem id="fs-idm5850912">
<para id="fs-idm5850656">Reiknaðu jónunarfastann fyrir hverja af eftirfarandi sýrum eða bösum út frá jónunarfastanum á samoka basa þeirra eða samoka sýru:</para>
<para id="fs-idm5850112">(a) F<sup>−</sup></para>
<para id="fs-idm5849472">(b) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idp69550272">(c) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>AsO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>3−</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idp69552448">(d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idp69556896">(e) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idp69558944">(f) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HC</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> (sem basi)</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm82380304">
<problem id="fs-idm82380048">
<para id="fs-idm82379792">Reiknaðu jónunarfastann fyrir hverja af eftirfarandi sýrum eða bösum út frá jónunarfastanum á samoka basa þeirra eða samoka sýru:</para>
<para id="fs-idm82379248">(a) HTe<sup>−</sup> (sem basi)</para>
<para id="fs-idm82378480">(b) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idm82374672">(c) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HAsO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2–</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> (sem basi)</para>
<para id="fs-idm82372368">(d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> (sem basi)</para>
<para id="fs-idm82370192">(e) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-idp30723328">(f) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HSO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> (sem basi)</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp30725632">
<para id="fs-idp30725888">(a) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>b</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> (b) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>a</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.6</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> (c) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>b</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5.9</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> (d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>b</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> (e) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>b</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> (f) <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>b</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm8587472">
<problem id="fs-idm8587216">
<para id="fs-idm8586960">Notaðu <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> gildið 1,4 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−5</sup> til að staðsetja <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Al</m:mtext><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>3+</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> á réttum stað í <link target-id="CNX_Chem_14_03_strengths"/>.</para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp3008704">
<problem id="fs-idp3008960">
<para id="fs-idp3009216">Reiknaðu styrk allra uppleystra efna í hverri af eftirfarandi lausnum af sýrum eða bösum. Gerðu ráð fyrir að hægt sé að hunsa jónun vatns og sýndu að hægt sé að hunsa breytinguna á upphafsstyrknum.</para>
<para id="fs-idp3011616">(a) 0,0092 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> HClO, veik sýra</para>
<para id="fs-idp3012624">(b) 0,0784 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>5</sub>NH<sub>2</sub>, veikur basi</para>
<para id="fs-idp3014784">(c) 0,0810 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> HCN, veik sýra</para>
<para id="fs-idp3015792">(d) 0,11 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>N, veikur basi</para>
<para id="fs-idp3017568">(e) 0,120 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Fe</m:mtext><m:msub><m:mrow>
<m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/>
<m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2+</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> veik sýra, <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> = 1,6 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−7</sup></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm97049136">
<para id="fs-idm97048880">(a) <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:msup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo>
<m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>ClO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mtext>HClO</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/>
<m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.0092</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac>
<m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>0.0092</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.9</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <newline/> Lausn fyrir <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> gefur 1,63 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−5</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>. Þetta gildi er minna en 5% af 0,0092, þannig að sú forsenda að það megi vanrækja það er gild. Þar af leiðandi er styrkur uppleystra efna við jafnvægi:<newline/> [H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>] = [ClO<sup>–</sup>] = 1,6 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−5</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis><newline/> [HClO<sup>–</sup>] = 0,0092 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis><newline/> [OH<sup>−</sup>] = 6,1 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−10</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> (b) <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/>
<m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/>
<m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>OH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.0784</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>≈</m:mo>
<m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>0.0784</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <newline/> Lausn fyrir <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> gefur 5,81 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−6</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>. Þetta gildi er minna en 5% af 0,0784, þannig að sú forsenda að það megi vanrækja það er gild. Þar af leiðandi er styrkur uppleystra efna við jafnvægi:<newline/> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>C</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>H</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn>
<m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = [OH<sup>−</sup>] = 5,8 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−6</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> <newline/> [C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>5</sub>NH<sub>2</sub>] = 0,0784 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis><newline/> [H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>] = 1,7<m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−9</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> (c) <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:msup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>CN</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mtext>HCN</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.0810</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>0.0810</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.9</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math><newline/> Lausn fyrir <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> gefur 6,30 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−6</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>. Þetta gildi er minna en 5% af 0,0810, þannig að sú forsenda að það megi vanrækja það er gild. Þar af leiðandi er styrkur uppleystra efna við jafnvægi:<newline/> [H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>] = [CN<sup>−</sup>] = 6,3 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−6</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis><newline/> [HCN] = 0,0810 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis><newline/> [OH<sup>−</sup>] = 1,6 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−9</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> (d) <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>NH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>OH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>CH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.11</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>0.11</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6.3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math><newline/> Lausn fyrir <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> gefur 2,63 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>. Þetta gildi er minna en 5% af 0,11, þannig að sú forsenda að það megi vanrækja það er gild. Þar af leiðandi er styrkur uppleystra efna við jafnvægi:<newline/> [(CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>NH<sup>+</sup>] = [OH<sup>−</sup>] = 2,6 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−3</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis><newline/> [(CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>3</sub>N] = 0,11 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis><newline/> [H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>] = 3,8 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−12</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>;<newline/> (e) <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mtext>Fe</m:mtext><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>OH</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:msup><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mtext>Fe</m:mtext><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2+</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.120</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>0.120</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.6</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math><newline/> Lausn fyrir <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> gefur 1,39 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−4</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>. Þetta gildi er minna en 5% af 0,120, þannig að sú forsenda að það megi vanrækja það er gild. Þar af leiðandi er styrkur uppleystra efna við jafnvægi:<newline/> [Fe(H<sub>2</sub>O)<sub>5</sub>(OH)<sup>+</sup>] = [H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>] = 1,4 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−4</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis><newline/> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mtext>Fe</m:mtext><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2+</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 0,120 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis><newline/> [OH<sup>−</sup>] = 7,2 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−11</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm78141920">
<problem id="fs-idm78141664">
<para id="fs-idm78141408">Própíónsýra, C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H (<emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> = 1,34 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−5</sup>), er notuð við framleiðslu á kalsíumprópíónati, rotvarnarefni í matvælum. Hvert er pH-gildi 0,698-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> lausnar af C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>5</sub>CO<sub>2</sub>H?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp35201920">
<problem id="fs-idp35202176">
<para id="fs-idp35202432">Borðedik er 5,0% massalausn af ediksýru í vatni. Ef eðlismassi borðediks er 1,007 g/cm<sup>3</sup>, hvert er þá pH-gildið?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idp35203456">
<para id="fs-idp35203712">pH = 2,41</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm68637072">
<problem id="fs-idm68636816">
<para id="fs-idm68636560">Jónunarfasti mjólkursýru, CH<sub>3</sub>CH(OH)CO<sub>2</sub>H, sýru sem finnst í blóði eftir mikla áreynslu, er 1,36 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−4</sup>. Ef 20,0 g af mjólkursýru eru notuð til að búa til lausn með rúmmálið 1,00 L, hver er þá styrkur oxóníumjónar í lausninni?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm75310368">
<problem id="fs-idm75310112">
<para id="fs-idm75309856">Nikótín, C<sub>10</sub>H<sub>14</sub>N<sub>2</sub>, er basi sem tekur við tveimur róteindum (<emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b1</sub> = 7 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−7</sup>, <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b2</sub> = 1,4 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−11</sup>). Hver er styrkur hvers efnis sem er til staðar í 0,050-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> lausn af nikótíni?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm83649184">
<para id="fs-idm83648928">[C<sub>10</sub>H<sub>14</sub>N<sub>2</sub>] = 0,049 <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>; [C<sub>10</sub>H<sub>14</sub>N<sub>2</sub>H<sup>+</sup>] = 1,9 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−4</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>; <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mrow><m:mn>2+</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> = 1,4 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−11</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>; [OH<sup>−</sup>] = 1,9 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−4</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis>; [H<sub>3</sub>O<sup>+</sup>] = 5,3 <m:math><m:mo>×</m:mo></m:math> 10<sup>−11</sup> <emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idp85725440">
<problem id="fs-idp85725696">
<para id="fs-idp85725952">Sýrustig (pH) 0,23-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> lausnar af HF er 1,92. Ákvarðaðu <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> fyrir HF út frá þessum gögnum.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm95676256">
<problem id="fs-idm95676000">
<para id="fs-idm95675744">Sýrustig (pH) 0,15-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> lausnar af <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HSO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> er 1,43. Ákvarðaðu <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub> fyrir <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mrow><m:mtext>HSO</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mrow/><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> út frá þessum gögnum.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm95670144">
<para id="fs-idm95669888"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>a</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm82940432">
<problem id="fs-idm82940176">
<para id="fs-idm82939920">Sýrustig (pH) 0,10-<emphasis effect="italics">M</emphasis> lausnar af koffíni er 11,70. Ákvarðaðu <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b</sub> fyrir koffín út frá þessum gögnum:<newline/> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>l</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo stretchy="false">⇌</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msub><m:mtext>C</m:mtext><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>N</m:mtext><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msub><m:mtext>O</m:mtext><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msub><m:mrow/><m:msup><m:mtext>H</m:mtext><m:mtext>+</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mtext>OH</m:mtext></m:mrow><m:mtext>−</m:mtext></m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-idm93044768">
<problem id="fs-idm93044512">
<para id="fs-idm93044256">Sýrustig (pH) lausnar af heimilisammoníaki, 0,950 M lausn af NH<sub>3,</sub> er 11,612. Ákvarðaðu <emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b</sub> fyrir NH<sub>3</sub> út frá þessum gögnum.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm93042096">
<para id="fs-idm93041840"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msub><m:mi>K</m:mi><m:mtext>b</m:mtext></m:msub><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.77</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>−5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</section>
</content>
<glossary>
<definition id="fs-idp86058640">
<term>sýrujónunarfasti (<emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>a</sub>) (e. acid ionization constant (ka))</term>
<meaning id="fs-idp86058640-meaning">jafnvægisfasti fyrir sýrujónunarhvarf</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-idp86060672">
<term>basajónunarfasti (<emphasis effect="italics">K</emphasis><sub>b</sub>) (e. base ionization constant (kb))</term>
<meaning id="fs-idp86060672-meaning">jafnvægisfasti fyrir basajónunarhvarf</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-idm94080720">
<term>jöfnunaráhrif (e. leveling effect)</term>
<meaning id="fs-idm94080720-meaning">sú athugun að sýru-basastyrkur uppleystra efna í tilteknum leysi takmarkast við einkennandi sýru- og basaefni leysisins (í vatni, hýdróníum- og hýdroxíðjónir)</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-idm94074528">
<term>oxósýra (e. oxyacid)</term>
<meaning id="fs-idm94074528-meaning">þrígilt efnasamband með sýrueiginleika, en sameindir þess innihalda miðlægt málmleysingjafrumeind sem er tengd einni eða fleiri O-frumeindum, þar sem að minnsta kosti ein þeirra er tengd jónanlegri H-frumeind</meaning>
</definition>
<definition id="fs-idm94073376">
<term>jónunarprósenta (e. percent ionization)</term>
<meaning id="fs-idm94073376-meaning">hlutfall styrks jónaðrar sýru og upphafsstyrks sýru, gefið upp sem prósentutala</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary>
</document>